      "about": {
        "title": "A house-shaped classic",
        "lede": "The Georgian blends traditional cabin design with the warmth of natural cedar, and grows with you: sauna only, with a porch, or with a changeroom.",
        "items": [
          [
            "Dovetail corners, black steel roof",
            "Dovetail joinery makes a strong, long-lasting structure, topped with a 28-gauge textured black steel roof made in Canada."
          ],
          [
            "Room for the whole family",
            "Open-concept two-tier benches in an L shape seat five to six comfortably."
          ],
          [
            "Add a porch or changeroom",
            "A 29\" covered porch with built-in seating, or a 48\" changeroom to change and cool down out of the weather."
          ],
          [
            "Wood or electric",
            "Large enough for a wood-burning stove or a 240V electric heater. Handcrafted in Canada from Eastern White Cedar."
          ]
